  "coverage_summary": "P1-S004 consolidated the stronger test-randomness tranche at primary-source level: the original 1982 Demuth source was recovered and cross-normalized without erasing its historical domain/notation; difference, balanced and Oberwolfach randomness now have exact source-grounded definitions; and the strict/incomparability graph through 2-random, weak-2, Martin-Löf and the stronger moving-component notions is recorded only where inspected sources state it. Phase 1 remains incomplete, especially for generalized measures/spaces, higher randomness, finite-string/random-real, category/genericity and pseudorandomness-boundary coverage.",
